rs</strong> for crafting\u2014or collect them just because you can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21be2cb74eb4081579d97df434cff278.webp?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.poster.avif?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.webm?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a0e402ca51959c602b12e25461760930.mp4?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything in this massive world is destructible: trees, wheelbarrows, plows, barrels\u2014even houses. Gather materials to learn new skills and craft a wide array of items. Use your axe, hammer, sword or powerful scavenged modern tools to <strong>destroy nearly everything</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/b39f3c782391f6436bb9af91a0970b91.webp?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.poster.avif?t=1761056442\" width=616 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.webm?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.mp4?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customize a vast array of weapons, armor, and tools to grow stronger. Create gear that fits your playstyle: block and parry with sword and shield, hurl deadly spears, or strike from afar with a bow. Spice it up with scavenged modern artifacts \u2014 grenades, mines, and shotguns \u2014 or build an anvil to mix and match blades and hilts for unique weapon combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.poster.avif?t=1761056442\" width=616 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.webm?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/13476528691c69faba52402a7a171b65.webp?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.poster.avif?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.webm?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/72505378796671eccfcc33dff2e17e7c.mp4?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once equipped for the journey, a vast and enchanting realm awaits. Gather resources, hunt wildlife, farm local plants gather herbs, shrooms and berries, uncover hidden treasures, complete mysterious quests, and brave awe-inspiring wonders and dangers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a campfire, build a workbench, forge, or even a teleporter \u2014 or craft a full house! Venture further by establishing campsites and outposts along the way. A well-equipped outpost can make all the difference when facing the challenges of this strange new frontier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/a7f92c55faedf6839c5f23017c562ef6.webp?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.poster.avif?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.webm?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/724022aab8d2b27f98ee4c0417e60212.mp4?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the world for <strong>Dysplaced Artifacts\u00a0</strong>\u2014 modern items that have seeped from our realm into theirs. Some are incredibly powerful, and the locals mistake them for magic. You can even learn to craft local counterparts, like grenades forged in copper or bronze casings.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/145b2ff649ac066c3e09264479eb451d.webp?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/2e7eec8cb6edff0a0e8653fa57780b69.avif?t=1761056442\" width=1170 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you arrive, a sinister force consumes the realm\u2014spreading chaos and driving its people into exile. They are called <strong>the Eternals</strong>, and you have been called to fight them. Are you ready to steel yourself against the scourge devouring these lands?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/248585dcb9e1557a23b483fc26e7e608.webp?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.poster.avif?t=1761056442\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.webm?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/533704c7b05c2ac257129cb006ef36fd.mp4?t=1761056442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can conquer this strange new world alone\u2014or bring a friend. Prepare for a shared experience in a dream-infused world where everyone can find both <strong>tranquility</strong> and <strong>adventure</strong>.</p>","developers":["10tons Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/0ce1df293e441de27202ed4e47a4fa1ede4d7fe5/header.jpg?t=1761056442","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.8+ recommended<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2046 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> SM 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430390/1743047507/a2be408f1a9f3201b6328f215efa99682ac723f8/1761051128/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761052976","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430390/1743047507/a2be408f1a9f3201b6328f215efa99682ac723f8/1761051128/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761052976","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430390/1743047507/a2be408f1a9f3201b6328f215efa99682ac723f8/1761051128/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761052976","id":257220493,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220493/movie480.mp4?t=1761052976","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220493/movie_max.mp4?t=1761052976"},"name":"Dysplaced Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220493/8f2ca40980c336d5ab9589bfa4da4764f965b2eb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761052976","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com